+//   mode i32 : plain 32-bit bfe+IMul+IAdd. Operands are 8-bit sign-extended, so NIR
+//              range analysis can prove 24-bit safety and select V_MAD_I32_I24 --
+//              a full-rate fused 24-bit multiply-add with a 32-bit accumulator,
+//              i.e. 1 VALU/MAC, provably exact for |a|,|b| <= 128.
